{
  "body_human_readable": "**Oklahoma City Thunder Clinch 2025 NBA Championship Title**\n\nThe Oklahoma City Thunder have been crowned the champions of the 2024-2025 NBA season, defeating the Indiana Pacers in a hard-fought seven-game series. The Thunder secured their first championship since relocating from Seattle and the franchise's first title since 1979.\n\nThe finals, which concluded on June 22, 2025, saw the Thunder emerge victorious with a 4-3 series win. Oklahoma City's superstar guard, Shai Gilgeous-Alexander, was named the NBA Finals Most Valuable Player. This capped a remarkable season for Gilgeous-Alexander, who also won the regular season MVP award.\n\nThe Thunder entered the playoffs with the best record in the Western Conference, finishing the regular season with a dominant 68-14 record. The Indiana Pacers, representing the Eastern Conference, proved to be a formidable opponent, pushing the series to a decisive seventh game.\n\nThe championship marks a significant achievement for the Oklahoma City Thunder, culminating a season of impressive performances and securing their place in NBA history.",
